et Women&#39;S Ladies Gray Suit">2pcs Women'S High-Waist Cinched Mid-Length Blazer And Cape Sleeve Gray Suit Set, Modern Women'S Clothing Solid Color Two-Piece Outfit Trousers Set Women'S Ladies Gray Suit</h1></div><a href="https://www.temu.com/mall.html" class="a-raak6 goodsItemLinkA-13C_c" role="presentation"><div class="salesWrap-1p3Lz"><div class="shopSaleInfo-21cLX" role="presentation"><span aria-label="2.6K+ sold" role="textbox">(<span class="saleTipsFirst-27KbT">2.6K+ sold</span>)</span>, <!-- -->by</div><div class="shopInfo-3dxtT"><div class="shopIcon-2veHS" role="img" aria-label="logo of Xiantao Yisen clothing"><img alt="" data-cui-image="1" data-state="succ" class="new-cui-img-3czqs " src="./sets2_files/f6d525c3-9d16-4df4-9bab-2503aecd4d04_300x300.jpeg" data-did-mount="1"></div><div class="shopText-3z9UF" role="link" aria-label="click to jump to Xiantao Yisen clothing">Xiantao Yisen clothing<!-- --> <!-- -->(50K+ sold)</div><div class="shopArrowWrap-vjjyT" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" class="arrowWrap-3p0Wm right-3Y0ZW shopArrow-1jSPW" role="img" alt="common_arrows"><path d="M846.6 329.7c19.9-17.2 49.9-15 67.1 4.9 15.4 17.9 15.2 44 0.5 61.6l-5.4 5.5-365.3 315.5c-15.9 13.7-38.5 15.2-55.8 4.6l-6.3-4.6-366.1-315.5c-19.9-17.1-22.1-47.2-5-67 15.4-17.9 41.3-21.5 60.8-9.6l6.2 4.6 335.1 288.7 334.2-288.7z"></path></svg></div></div></div></a><div class="priceAndCommentWrap-35_s_"><div class="leftPriceWrap-3uz6r"><div class="salePrice-2fkrz" aria-label="EGP1,935.48" role="heading" aria-level="1" tabindex="0"><div class="salePriceAmount-1wGT0 container-2OsB1"><span class="priceWrap-1wGpa priceWrap-1DZUc" aria-label="EGP1,935.48" tabindex="0" role="button"><span aria-hidden="false" class="currencyUnit-yms06">EGP</span><span class="" data-price="2" aria-hidden="false">1,935.48</span></span></div></div><div class="marketPrice-1Ms8G container-2OsB1"><span class="marketPrice-3si4d" aria-label="Original price 2,178.53" tabindex="0" role="text">2,178.53</span></div><span class="discountTip-1ak0R">-11%</span></div><div class=""></div></div></div><div class="commentsWrap-2dQfu" role="link" tabindex="0"><div tabindex="0" role="button" class="container-3fhZC"><div class="rowWrap-3AOqa"><div class="itemWrap-3-2sd"><div class="item-2CBzX"><span class="userName-AapPb">A***a</span><span class="text-1M0m3">so lovely, size is true to size, the fit , model and finishing is very nice. I wear 14/16 and xxk is slightly bigger.</span></div></div><div class="itemWrap-3-2sd"><div class="item-2CBzX"><span class="userName-AapPb">I***a</span><span class="text-1M0m3">The suit is good. It's made of synthetic material, but of good quality; the fabric is quite dense and holds its shape well. The instructions include a belt. I chose two sizes larger than usual, but you can safely go for XL if you normally wear an L. The top has buttons and a sewn-in flap that is secured with an elastic band to the button under the collar. The sleeves aren't too tight. The entire garment is quite long. For my height of 165 cm, I can only wear these pants with heels or have them hemmed. The pants are very wide!!!! The leg width is 35 cm, the hip width is 62 cm, and the length is 109 cm. I turned up the sleeves of the blouse. The blouse is 55 cm long, has a chest circumference of 112 cm, sleeve width of 18 cm, and a length of about 63 cm. I definitely recommend buying this suit!!!! When I ordered it, there weren't any reviews or photos available.</span></div></div></div><svg viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" class="arrowWrap-14r6o right-3DdjX picArrow-RDq05" alt="common_arrows" aria-label="common_arrows"><path d="M846.6 329.7c19.9-17.2 49.9-15 67.1 4.9 15.4 17.9 15.2 44 0.5 61.6l-5.4 5.5-365.3 315.5c-15.9 13.7-38.5 15.2-55.8 4.6l-6.3-4.6-366.1-315.5c-19.9-17.1-22.1-47.2-5-67 15.4-17.9 41.3-21.5 60.8-9.6l6.2 4.6 335.1 288.7 3