rk Brown"},{"specId":8002,"specValue":"Label size: XXL","parentSpecId":3001,"specKey":"Size","metricSpecName":"XXL","usSpecName":"XXL"}]},"mallInfo":{"mallId":"634418219229606","mallName":"Xiantao Yisen clothing","mallLogo":"https:\u002F\u002Fimg.kwcdn.com\u002Fsupplier-public-tag\u002F1fad1809b0\u002Ff6d525c3-9d16-4df4-9bab-2503aecd4d04_300x300.jpeg","followerNumUnit":["699","Followers"],"goodsNum":"14","salesNum":"50K+","goodsSalesNumUnit":["50K+","Sold"],"goodsSalesNumText":"50K+ sold","mallStar":4.6,"temuRoute":"\u002Fmall.html?_bg_fs=1&mall_id=634418219229606&goods_id=601103278162324","mallRoute":"\u002Fmall.html?_bg_fs=1&mall_id=634418219229606&goods_id=601103278162324","seoUrl":"\u002Fmall.html?_bg_fs=1&mall_id=634418219229606&goods_id=601103278162324"},"goodsReviewVo":{"goodsReviewList":[{"reviewId":"74408846033961364","avatar":"https:\u002F\u002Favatar-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Favatarj-eu\u002Favatar\u002Fdefault\u002F7d96f863-b4c1-43d6-8f03-ebd1c4e23e25.png","name":"An***ni","comment":"This is a wonderful two part elegant look, great also for work and it looks really great when you put it on. It came a bit too wrinkled, but with a steamer you can easily solve that problem.","specs":"[{\"spec_key\":\"Color\",\"spec_value\":\"Dark Gray\"},{\"spec_key\":\"Size\",\"spec_value\":\"Label size: M\"}]","time":1762637047,"score":5,"linkUrl":"\u002Fbgc_comments.html?goods_id=601103278162324&_bg_fs=1&_bg_tc=ffffff&mall_id=634418219229606","pictures":[],"concatTimeLang":"on Nov 8, 2025","lang":"en"},{"reviewId":"74469184133677460","avatar":"https:\u002F\u002Favatar-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Favatarj-eu\u002FMjEw\u002FCgI2WRIITFY5bFRzOUQaIOGBnwBakq1X3uG8gbeUgyL24kwGco-BZsNojn2gwfoDMAI-CgI2WRIITFY5bFRzOUQaMKq5RP1rG009FS3evdImSpG0FEHfb1pTIgDddIDpt6n5HW0m-z9OJ17_dmAa5XAnSjAC?imageMogr2\u002Fthumbnail\u002F100x","name":"Amal Elderaa","comment":"so lovely, size is true to size, the fit , model and finishing is very nice. I wear 14\u002F16 and xxk is slightly bigger.","specs":"[{\"spec_key\":\"Color\",\"spec_value\":\"Dark Gray\"},{\"spec_key\":\"Size\",\"spec_value\":\"Label size: XXL\"}]","time":1767379185,"score":5,"linkUrl":"\u002Fbgc_comments.html?goods_id=601103278162324&_bg_fs=1&_bg_tc=ffffff&mall_id=634418219229606","pictures":[],"concatTimeLang":"on Jan 2, 2026","lang":"en"},{"reviewId":"74473760589103508","avatar":"https:\u002F\u002Favatar-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Favatarj-eu\u002FMTA4\u002FCgI2WRIITFY5bFRzOUQaIHkNUB3k1twaOyWZshv6D5AufvyurfFk5tTw-bqvzd7sMAI-CgI2WRIITFY5bFRzOUQaMA9iZh1PzF6tc1EhIuRn1Bb28sKKw09tq4WtxMk4YZILOfZJ0AL5s82WRsYWetaFujAC?imageMogr2\u002Fthumbnail\u002F100x","name":"Irina Nikitina","comment":"The suit is good. It's made of synthetic material, but of good quality; the fabric is quite dense and holds its shape well. The instructions include a belt. I chose two sizes larger than usual, but you can safely go for XL if you normally wear an L. The top has buttons and a sewn-in flap that is secured with an elastic band to the button under the collar. The sleeves aren't too tight. The entire garment is quite long. For my height of 165 cm, I can only wear these pants with heels or have them hemmed. The pants are very wide!!!! The leg width is 35 cm, the hip width is 62 cm, and the length is 109 cm. I turned up the sleeves of the blouse. The blouse is 55 cm long, has a chest circumference of 112 cm, sleeve width of 18 cm, and a length of about 63 cm. I definitely recommend buying this suit!!!! When I ordered it, there weren't any reviews or photos available.","specs":"[{\"spec_key\":\"Color\",\"spec_value\":\"Dark Brown\"},{\"spec_key\":\"Size\",\"spec_value\":\"Label size: XXL\"}]","time":1767718422,"score":5,"linkUrl":"\u002Fbgc_comments.html?goods_id=601103278162324&_bg_fs=1&_bg_tc=ffffff&mall_id=634418219229606","pictures":[{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Frewimg-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Freview-image\u002F21a4883e28\u002Fbf117eb3-bb3c-4f63-9d36-96c5daa42041.jpeg","width":900,"height":1200},{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Frewimg-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Freview-image\u002F21a4883e28\u002F89b85948-880d-46d6-bb1d-15d43a9721ab.jpeg","width":675,"height":1200},{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Frewimg-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Freview-image\u002F21a4883e28\u002F441db96e-27ac-4aea-b9a4-093e172adf90.jpeg","width":900,"height":1200},{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Frewimg-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Freview-image\u002F21a4883e28\u002Fe16fb082-9360-4394-b021-858ea3a49b6c.jpeg","width":900,"height":1200},{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Frewimg-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Freview-image\u002F21a4883e28\u002F562dca80-15da-4651-a147-67117de22d5a.jpeg","width":900,"height":1200}],"video":{"cover":{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Frewimg-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Freview-image\u002F21a4883e28\u002Fcf6abd8c-baff-492a-a2a1-543b6a7f39f6.jpeg","width":152,"height":270},"url":"https:\u002F\u002Frewvod-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Freview-video\u002F7555ad39d0572b3a5f20d4ee4904a547e629c8e0.f30.mp4","width":152,"height":270,"duration":54,"size":69849},"concatTimeLang":"on Jan 6, 2026","lang":"ru","reviewLang":{"translateComment":"The suit is good. It's made of synthetic material, but of good quality; the fabric is quite dense and holds its shape well. The instructions include a belt. I chose two sizes larger than usual, but you can safely go for XL if you normally wear an L. The top has buttons and a sewn-in flap that is secured with an elastic band to the button under the collar. The sleeves aren't too tight. The entire garment is quite long. For my height of 165 cm, I can only wear these pants with heels or have them hemmed. The pants are very wide!!!! The leg width is 35 cm, the hip width is 62 cm, and the length is 109 cm. I turned up the sleeves of the blouse. The blouse is 55 cm long, has a chest circumference of 112 cm, sleeve width of 18 cm, and a length of about 63 cm. I definitely recommend buying this suit!!!! When I ordered it, there weren't any reviews or photos available."}},{"reviewId":"74527505914020244","avatar":"https:\u002F\u002Favatar-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Favatarj-eu\u002Favatar\u002Fdefault\u002F7d96f863-b4c1-43d6-8f03-ebd1c4e23e25.png","name":"su***ta","comment":"Elegant and refined. A beautifully made set. Attention to detail is excellent. It was lovingly sewn and packed in a zip-lock bag. Compared to other suits I've bought on TEMU, this one stands out for its fabric quality, design elements, and the surprisingly good fit of the pants. The length of the pants is perfect for someone about 170 cm tall. Thank you TEMU for the timely and careful delivery. Super!","specs":"[{\"spec_key\":\"Color\",\"spec_value\":\"Dark Brown\"},{\"spec_key\":\"Size\",\"spec_value\":\"Label size: XXL\"}]","time":1771894289,"score":5,"linkUrl":"\u002Fbgc_comments.html?goods_id=601103278162324&_bg_fs=1&_bg_tc=ffffff&mall_id=634418219229606","pictures":[{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Frewimg-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Freview-image\u002F212a0c4c30\u002Fd911cb19-59be-403f-843d-1402eff63df9_711x948.jpeg","width":711,"height":948},{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Frewimg-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Freview-image\u002F212a0c4c30\u002F2d64210a-e8fd-452d-99fa-ba969361e316_803x1071.jpeg","width":803,"height":1071},{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Frewimg-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Freview-image\u002F212a0c4c30\u002Fa4332df1-fbba-490a-8da5-fa94374ed87f_748x998.jpeg","width":748,"height":998},{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Frewimg-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Freview-image\u002F212a0c4c30\u002F83c54a71-8791-451a-b2a0-74eb0ec55738_706x941.jpeg","width":706,"height":941}],"concatTimeLang":"on Feb 24, 2026","lang":"uk","reviewLang":{"translateComment":"Elegant and refined. A beautifully made set. Attention to detail is excellent. It was lovingly sewn and packed in a zip-lock bag. Compared to other suits I've bought on TEMU, this one stands out for its fabric quality, design elements, and the surprisingly good fit of the pants. The length of the pants is perfect for someone about 170 cm tall. Thank you TEMU for the timely and careful delivery. Super!"}},{"reviewId":"74508253219799444","avatar":"https:\u002F\u002Favatar-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Favatarj-eu\u002Favatar\u002Fdefault\u002F7d96f863-b4c1-43d6-8f03-ebd1c4e23e25.png","name":"sk***vo","comment":"The suit is nice. The stitching quality isn't the best, though; I had to remove a lot of loose threads. Overall, the price-to-quality ratio is good. It's a stylish design","specs":"[{\"spec_key\":\"Color\",\"spec_value\":\"Dark Brown\"},{\"spec_key\":\"Size\",\"spec_value\":\"Label size: XL\"}]","time":1770404563,"score":5,"linkUrl":"\u002Fbgc_comments.html?goods_id=601103278162324&_bg_fs=1&_bg_tc=ffffff&mall_id=634418219229606","pictures":[{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Frewimg-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Freview-image\u002F212a0c3850\u002Fd862fa23-eb6c-4317-89a2-e13c8fe68ec1_675x1200.jpeg","width":675,"height":1200},{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Frewimg-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Freview-image\u002F212a0c3850\u002F7f88c460-544d-4863-b772-6215f8182c26_675x1200.jpeg","width":675,"height":1200},{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Frewimg-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Freview-image\u002F212a0c3850\u002F51ce9fc3-ad93-45e2-8a24-17d6dc2a2c9b_675x1200.jpeg","width":675,"height":1200},{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Frewimg-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Freview-image\u002F212a0c3850\u002Fcbeb9625-1674-48d9-a0df-07a6cf872b92_675x1200.jpeg","width":675,"height":1200}],"concatTimeLang":"on Feb 6, 2026","lang":"ru","reviewLang":{"translateComment":"The suit is nice. The stitching quality isn't the best, though; I had to remove a lot of loose threads. Overall, the price-to-quality ratio is good. It's a stylish design"}},{"reviewId":"74588609323221396","avatar":"https:\u002F\u002Favatar-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Favatarj-eu\u002FOTg\u002FCgI2WRIITFY5bFRzOUQaIKT5aeTUTNWrHVRfX-rsatwMgLl3N7a44AFfldT-rcjEMAI-CgI2WRIITFY5bFRzOUQaMLE6xCLg5NCAWszM5Hn9T4GfDvYmqg3VMyCHa2m8t0t7wfKWcRgipALcI6ykJH6SrTAC?imageMogr2\u002Fthumbnail\u002F100x","name":"Rosanna Lo Medico","comment":"Beautifully sewn, really well done! It's a shame the fabric is acrylic, but unlike other fabrics from temu, this one is superior and well-structured. The only problem for me is the size of the pants. As an XXL, they turned out small and short. I'm 1.75m tall, and they should fit loosely like in the photo on the model, but they're very tight on me, especially around the waist. The belt included is smaller than the waist circumference of the pants. I usually wear an XL.\nI won't be returning it because it's really beautiful. I'm going to give it as a gift to my sister, who is shorter and smaller than me","specs":"[{\"spec_key\":\"Color\",\"spec_value\":\"Dark Brown\"},{\"spec_key\":\"Size\",\"spec_value\":\"Label size: XXL\"}]","time":1776693026,"score":4,"linkUrl":"\u002Fbgc_comments.html?goods_id=601103278162324&_bg_fs=1&_bg_tc=ffffff&mall_id=634418219229606","pictures":[{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Frewimg-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Freview-image\u002F21140d641a0\u002Fe8951873-2d23-471c-95f9-7af5adaa1d1d.jpeg","width":900,"height":1200},{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Frewimg-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Freview-image\u002F21140d641a0\u002Fa6ea5880-64e4-4ec3-91a4-a3c7e63e98df.jpeg","width":900,"height":1200},{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Frewimg-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Freview-image\u002F21140d641a0\u002Fcbd2a45c-ec8b-4bee-8ee0-b2af5b26be90.jpeg","width":900,"height":1200},{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Frewimg-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Freview-image\u002F21140d641a0\u002F4055895b-c444-49a2-b223-349063414bc2.jpeg","width":900,"height":1200}],"video":{"cover":{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Frewimg-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Freview-image\u002F21140d641a0\u002F9ba8c8f0-57b2-4556-881f-aca17927506f.jpeg","width":144,"height":176},"url":"https:\u002F\u002Frewvod-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Freview-video\u002Fcd4f9cc27a6660eb4e1777bd9d640b4162842dcb.f30.mp4","width":144,"height":176,"duration":31,"size":9592},"concatTimeLang":"on Apr 20, 2026","lang":"it","reviewLang":{"translateComment":"Beautifully sewn, really well done! It's a shame the fabric is acrylic, but unlike other fabrics from temu, this one is superior and well-structured. The only problem for me is the size of the pants. As an XXL, they turned out small and short. I'm 1.75m tall, and they should fit loosely like in the photo on the model, but they're very tight on me, especially around the waist. The belt included is smaller than the waist circumference of the pants. I usually wear an XL.\nI won't be returning it because it's really beautiful. I'm going to give it as a gift to my sister, who is shorter and smaller than me"}},{"reviewId":"74452566871654804","avatar":"https:\u002F\u002Favatar-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Favatarj-eu\u002Favatar\u002Fdefault\u002F7d96f863-b4c1-43d6-8f03-ebd1c4e23e25.png","name":"ba***ki","comment":"This is the best item I've ever bought from here. It's truly amazing! The fabric is perfect, and the fit is just right!","specs":"[{\"spec_key\":\"Color\",\"spec_value\":\"Dark Gray\"},{\"spec_key\":\"Size\",\"spec_value\":\"Label size: S\"}]","time":1766087594,"score":5,"linkUrl":"\u002Fbgc_comments.html?goods_id=601103278162324&_bg_fs=1&_bg_tc=ffffff&mall_id=634418219229606","pictures":[{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Frewimg-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Freview-image\u002F2019505c8f8\u002Ff9416045-0f44-484d-9c8d-960b3111f28c.jpeg","width":903,"height":1200},{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Frewimg-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Freview-image\u002F2019505c8f8\u002Fe4d939b3-e4cb-48e7-9b5a-d17f1b409b31.jpeg","width":903,"height":1200}],"concatTimeLang":"on Dec 18, 2025","lang":"el","reviewLang":{"translateComment":"This is the best item I've ever bought from here. It's truly amazing! The fabric is perfect, and the fit is just right!"}},{"reviewId":"74559864147296660","avatar":"https:\u002F\u002Favatar-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Favatarj-eu\u002Favatar\u002Fdefault\u002F7d96f863-b4c1-43d6-8f03-ebd1c4e23e25.png","name":"no***hm","comment":"Very nice, soft, and flowing fabric. Very comfortable to wear. I chose the brown color. It looks great even when worn alone. It's a really great set that you don't find everywhere. I normally wear XS, but I can definitely wear this in size S as well.","specs":"[{\"spec_key\":\"Color\",\"spec_value\":\"Dark Brown\"},{\"spec_key\":\"Size\",\"spec_value\":\"Label size: S\"}]","time":1774462147,"score":5,"linkUrl":"\u002Fbgc_comments.html?goods_id=601103278162324&_bg_fs=1&_bg_tc=ffffff&mall_id=634418219229606","pictures":[],"concatTimeLang":"on Mar 25, 2026","lang":"de","reviewLang":{"translateComment":"Very nice, soft, and flowing fabric. Very comfortable to wear. I chose the brown color. It looks great even when worn alone. It's a really great set that you don't find everywhere. I normally wear XS, but I can definitely wear this in size S as well."}},{"reviewId":"74473917724508564","avatar":"https:\u002F\u002Favatar-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Favatarj-eu\u002FMTM\u002FCgI2WRIITFY5bFRzOUQaICFBXW4VfSr8J52-iQ6aVfhPaQdinmf-4dvSbo-8wc-GMAI-CgI2WRIITFY5bFRzOUQaMJgT2QOKANrApYy6bPnW10BsW1bHMfjMU5zNkwCG2bQw_4JRjIq6LV3WIvXZH8oZdTAC?imageMogr2\u002Fthumbnail\u002F100x","name":"Heidemarie Rudolf","comment":"This outfit is absolutely fantastic! It fits perfectly and the quality is great. I was initially worried about the wrinkles, but it turned out to be completely unfounded. It's very easy to iron, so I immediately ordered a second one!","specs":"[{\"spec_key\":\"Color\",\"spec_value\":\"Dark Gray\"},{\"spec_key\":\"Size\",\"spec_value\":\"Label size: M\"}]","time":1767684413,"score":5,"linkUrl":"\u002Fbgc_comments.html?goods_id=601103278162324&_bg_fs=1&_bg_tc=ffffff&mall_id=634418219229606","pictures":[],"concatTimeLang":"on Jan 6, 2026","lang":"de","reviewLang":{"translateComment":"This outfit is absolutely fantastic! It fits perfectly and the quality is great. I was initially worried about the wrinkles, but it turned out to be completely unfounded. It's very easy to iron, so I immediately ordered a second one!"}},{"reviewId":"74446480215130516","avatar":"https:\u002F\u002Favatar-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Favatarj-eu\u002Favatar\u002Fdefault\u002F7d96f863-b4c1-43d6-8f03-ebd1c4e23e25.png","name":"ap***in","comment":"The whole outfit is magnificent, very elegant. Moreover, it's comfortable to wear. The fabric holds its shape well, and the fit is perfect. The only minor issue